{
  "title": "创建表单",
  "html": "<html><head></head><body><div>\n  \n  <h1>创建表单</h1>\n  <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"1\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n    \n    <p class=\"Numbered\" style=\"margin-left: 50px;\">1. 在导航窗格中选择<strong>管理&gt;表单</strong>。将出现以下菜单：</p>\n    <p class=\"Numbered\" style=\"margin-left: 50px;\"><img src=\"/aras-images/formenu.jpg\"></p>\n    <p class=\"Numbered\" style=\"margin-left: 50px;\">2. 点击\"创建新表单\"。将出现一个空白表单：</p>\n    <p class=\"Numbered\" style=\"margin-left: 50px;\"><img src=\"/aras-images/newform.jpg\"></p>\n    \n    <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n      <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"1\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n        <p class=\"Numbered\" style=\"margin-left: 50px;\">3. 在表单字段中输入相应信息，然后点击保存条目按钮 <img src=\"/aras-images/saveitem.jpg\">。</p>\n        <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n          <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"1\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n            \n            <!--?rh-list_start level=\"1\" an=\"1\" class=\"rl-p-Figure_indented\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n              \n              <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n                \n\n</div></body></html>",
  "sourceFile": "Creating_a_Form.htm"
}